<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation steady at 6.00 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation steady at 6.00 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate, measured by the wholesale price index, remained unchanged at 6.00 percent in the week ended May 24 compared with the previous week, the Industry Ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES	 May 24	 May 17	May 25,1996</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +6.00	   +6.00	  +4.45</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)   323.5	   323.3	  305.2</p>
<p>Note - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended May 25, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
